// Cat paw: After the tell on the boundary wall nearest the densest group of ships, a paw (10 u
// pad) sweeps 90 u along an arc in 2 s and withdraws: 30 damage and 25 u/s knockback to ships
// touched, debris swept along, three claw grooves carved (about 36 `SubtractSphere` r 2.5
// spread over the sweep), never in spawn zones or the Heist vein. Needs an open boundary face
// with ships within 60 u.
// Behaviour: crates/ls-sim/src/events/cat_paw.rs (B3). Schema: `ls_sim::events::EventDef`.
EventDef(
    id: "cat_paw",
    name: "Cat paw",
    enabled: true,
    weight: 1.0,
    active_secs: 3.0,
    moods: [Grumpy],
    params: {
        "pad_radius": 10.0,
        "sweep_length": 90.0,
        "sweep_secs": 2.0,
        "damage": 30.0,
        "knockback": 25.0,
        "groove_radius": 2.5,
        "groove_edits": 36.0,
        "ship_range": 60.0,
    },
)
